{"id":"56f4afb708478100","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/602_Anderson–Kanger_道义逻辑.md","title":"602 Anderson–Kanger 道义逻辑","display":"602_Anderson–Kanger_道义逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\mathsf{s},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\mathsf{s},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{s}\">\\(\\mathsf{s}\\)</span> 是制裁常元公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}\\)</span> 是一元必然性构造子。显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Anderson--Kanger 的义务不是原始构造子，而是下列定义性记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_{AK}A=\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_{AK}A=\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\bot,\\mathsf{s}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{box}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\bot,\\mathsf{s}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{box}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span> 是满足以下闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{s}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\mathsf{s}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{602}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\mathsf{s})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\mathsf{s})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有公式的绑定变元集合为空：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{602}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{602}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{602}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{602}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{602}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{602}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\mathsf{s})=\\mathsf{s},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\mathsf{s})=\\mathsf{s},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\Box A)=\\Box\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\Box A)=\\Box\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{602}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{602}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{602}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{602}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{602}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{602}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,602}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,602}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{602}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{602}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{602}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{602}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{602}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{602}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态分配公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{602}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{602}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Anderson--Kanger 制裁常元的目标特异约束为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{San}^{602}\n=\n\\{\\neg\\Box\\neg\\mathsf{s}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{San}^{602}\n=\n\\{\\neg\\Box\\neg\\mathsf{s}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{602}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{San}^{602}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{602}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{602}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{San}^{602}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{602}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{602}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{602}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{602}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{602}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{602}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{602}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{602}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{602}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{602}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示分式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{602}A}{\\vdash_{602}\\Box A}\\;(Nec).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{602}A}{\\vdash_{602}\\Box A}\\;(Nec).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>。每行满足以下之一：</p>\n<h2 id=\"6.1-假设行\">6.1 假设行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.2-公理行\">6.2 公理行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{602},\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{602},\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.3-分离规则行\">6.3 分离规则行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_k=A_j\\to A_i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.4-必然化规则行\">6.4 必然化规则行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\Box A_j,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i=\\Box A_j,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{602}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{602}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{602}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{602}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{602}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{602}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{602}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{602}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{602}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{602}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义定理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{602}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{602}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{602}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{602}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{602}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\ \n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{602}(\\Gamma),\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{602}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{602}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\ \n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{602}(\\Gamma),\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{602}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-义务缩写的句法展开\">8. 义务缩写的句法展开</h1>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\)</span>，义务公式的可用记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_{AK}A\">\\(O_{AK}A\\)</span> 都按</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_{AK}A=\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_{AK}A=\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>展开后再进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{602}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{602}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{602}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{602}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{602}\">\\(\\vdash_{602}\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_{AK}\">\\(O_{AK}\\)</span> 不出现在最终元组中。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与满足\">9. 语义结构与满足</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"602\">\\(602\\)</span>-制裁 Kripke 模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AKMod}_{602}\">\\(\\mathsf{AKMod}_{602}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,R,V,S),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,R,V,S),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq W\">\\(S\\subseteq W\\)</span> 是制裁常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{s}\">\\(\\mathsf{s}\\)</span> 的解释，并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall w\\in W\\ \\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv\\land v\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall w\\in W\\ \\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv\\land v\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该局部约束恰使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\neg\\mathsf{s}\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\neg\\mathsf{s}\\)</span> 在每个世界成立。满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{602}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{602}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\mathsf{s}\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in S,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\mathsf{s}\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in S,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{602}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{602}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{602}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{602}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,v\\Vdash_{602}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,v\\Vdash_{602}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此定义性义务的满足子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}O_{AK}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow(\\mathcal M,v\\not\\Vdash_{602}A\\Rightarrow v\\in S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}O_{AK}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow(\\mathcal M,v\\not\\Vdash_{602}A\\Rightarrow v\\in S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{602}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,V,S)\\in\\mathsf{AKMod}_{602}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{602}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,V,S)\\in\\mathsf{AKMod}_{602}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{602}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目与普通正规模态逻辑的差异是：它局部引入制裁常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{s}\">\\(\\mathsf{s}\\)</span>，并把义务 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_{AK}A\">\\(O_{AK}A\\)</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s})\">\\(\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s})\\)</span>，再加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\neg\\mathsf{s}\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\neg\\mathsf{s}\\)</span> 保证制裁常元不是必然矛盾。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{AK}_{602}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{s},\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\operatorname{FV}_{602},\\operatorname{BV}_{602},\\mathsf{Subst}_{602},\\operatorname{Sub}_{602},\\equiv_{\\alpha,602},\\mathsf{Ax}_{602},\\mathsf{Rule}_{602},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{602},\\operatorname{last}_{602},\\vdash_{602},\\mathsf{Thm}_{602},\\mathsf{Cert}_{602},\n\\mathsf{AKMod}_{602},\\Vdash_{602},\\models_{602}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{AK}_{602}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{s},\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\operatorname{FV}_{602},\\operatorname{BV}_{602},\\mathsf{Subst}_{602},\\operatorname{Sub}_{602},\\equiv_{\\alpha,602},\\mathsf{Ax}_{602},\\mathsf{Rule}_{602},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{602},\\operatorname{last}_{602},\\vdash_{602},\\mathsf{Thm}_{602},\\mathsf{Cert}_{602},\n\\mathsf{AKMod}_{602},\\Vdash_{602},\\models_{602}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含制裁常元上的句法模态演算、定义性义务缩写、可能世界语义、制裁解释与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或其他元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"6.1-假设行","text":"6.1 假设行","level":2},{"id":"6.2-公理行","text":"6.2 公理行","level":2},{"id":"6.3-分离规则行","text":"6.3 分离规则行","level":2},{"id":"6.4-必然化规则行","text":"6.4 必然化规则行","level":2},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-义务缩写的句法展开","text":"8. 义务缩写的句法展开","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与满足","text":"9. 语义结构与满足","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\mathsf{s},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"O_{AK}A=\\Box(\\neg A\\to\\mathsf{s}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\bot,\\mathsf{s}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{box}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{s}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\bot)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\mathsf{s})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{602}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{602}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{602}(A)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{602}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{602}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sig